comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-15T06:54:29.619Z",codex-agent,"Baseline: CI already has workflow_dispatch. Development dependency graph includes direct fast-glob 3.3.3 plus pm-ops 2026.10.6 carrying micromatch 4.0.8 and braces 3.0.3; npm ci reports 4 high findings. No repository code imports fast-glob. Remove the unused direct dependency and upgrade exact pm-ops to the latest published 2026.10.14, retaining SDK pins and all thresholds."
  "2026-10-15T06:59:16.994Z",codex-agent,"npm release:check currently fails at coverage: 116 tests, 115 pass, 1 fail, 0 skips; all four measured coverage dimensions are 100%. The failing test expects the canonical attestation verifier to accept the tracked release workflow. pm-ops 2026.10.14 refuses its pre-existing review-thread while/read fragment as unresolved executable expansion. Auditing origin/main release.yml bytes reproduces the same refusal and that workflow has no diff. Follow-up: pm-review-release-scanner-blocker, related to ops-0u7l. Preserve the gate and workflow; run Bun independently and remaining gates separately."
  "2026-10-15T07:03:09.728Z",codex-agent,"Final verification: isolated npm and Bun release checks each report 115/116 passing, 1 failure, 0 skips, with 100% measured coverage in all dimensions; the sole failure is the pre-existing release-workflow canonical scanner refusal tracked by pm-review-release-scanner-blocker. Separately npm run audit:prod, npm run pack:dry-run, npm run changelog:check and npm run test:install pass; packed npm/npx and native Bun/bunx acceptance is 1/1 with 0 skips. Full npm audit --include=dev is clean and both glob-chain trees are empty. The only closed item is pm-review-dev-audit, as authorized. Leave the rollout chore in_progress for orchestrator review."
